(INSTRUCTIONS ON ROLL NO. SLIP) Tj
0.00 -20.36 TD
(1. It is advisable to visit your Centre Location, a day before test and report at your Centre 01 hour before the start of test.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(2. Mobile Phones, Calculator and other electronic devices shall not be carried to the Test Centre. University/Centre staff is neither allowed) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(nor responsible for keeping any such device/belongings.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(3. Carry your Roll No. Slip, attested copy of Matric/SSC Certificate and proof of fee payment with you to the centre for verification. ) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(4. Bring a Transparent Clipboard and use a black ballpoint for filling in the Bubble Sheet. Lead pencils and ink pens are not allowed.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(5. Returning of question paper along with Bubble Sheet to the invigilating staff at the centre is mandatory.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(6. Rough work may be done on the question paper but NOT on the Bubble Sheet.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(7. Candidate must see that his/her Bubble Sheet has duly been signed by the Superintendent/Additional Superintendent. The Bubble) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(Sheet not bearing the signature of the Superintendent /Additional Superintendent shall be cancelled.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(8. Test Category, Group Paper Code and Roll No. are to be filled in bubbles on the Bubble Sheet. The candidate must sign his/her bubble) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(sheet on the specified space.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(9. The question paper will consist of 100 Multiple-Choice Questions) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(10. Only ONE Bubble Sheet will be provided, use it carefully and do not fold it.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(11. Correct answers are to be filled on the Bubble Sheet. Fill in the bubble completely. The questions answered on the question paper will) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(not be graded.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(12. Each question has only one correct option. Double/multiple attempts and cutting on the Bubble Sheet is not accepted.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(13. Use of eraser / remover / blanco is not allowed.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(14. The candidates are directed to keep their ears visible during the course of test. ) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(15. There should not be any other mark on the Bubble Sheet.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(16. Use of rude/obscene language or misbehavior with the Supervisory Staff will result in the disqualification of the candidate.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(17. Any Candidate who stages a walk out/boycott or instigates others to do so in the Test Centre or around any Centre shall be liable for all) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(the damages.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(18. Un-authorised change of Centre/Subject/Group is strictly prohibited.) Tj
